{"timeline":[{"title":"Clone & Inspect","detail":"Pull the repository and review docker-compose plus language containers to understand service boundaries."},{"title":"Bootstrap Front-End","detail":"Bun + Next.js App Router delivers the static microsite with Tailwind, NextUI, and Framer Motion."},{"title":"Containerize Demos","detail":"Each language ships as an isolated service exposing JSON output on ports 7001-7003."},{"title":"Proxy Outputs","detail":"API route /api/demo?lang= fetches container responses for local development and documentation."},{"title":"Export & Deploy","detail":"Run bunx next build && bunx next export and publish the static bundle to Vercel or CloudFront via CI/CD."}]}